{"path":"eval/cases/comprehende-67/sources/pr.json","ref":"603bbf138873e1fab673ef73d0a8238cc225190a","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":1,"text":"{"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":2,"text":"  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/pull/67\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":3,"text":"  \"number\": 67,"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":4,"text":"  \"title\": \"Publish PR reviews to GitHub Pages\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":5,"text":"  \"body\": \"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\\nPR reviews no longer go through VibeDrop. `comprehende export` still writes the static site. This repo publishes that folder to GitHub Pages.\\n\\nA pull request review lives at `pr/<number>/`. A named site lives at `site/<name>/`.\\n\\nReview: https://matemolnar8.github.io/comprehende/pr/67/\\n\\n**One-time setup.** GitHub Pages is not on for this repo yet, so that URL 404s until you enable it. In Settings, Pages, choose Deploy from a branch, branch `gh-pages`, folder `/`. The orphan `gh-pages` branch is already on origin with `.nojekyll` and this PR's export under `pr/67/`.\\n\\n**Cleanup.** Closing a pull request removes `pr/<n>/` only. Named sites stay until TTL. A daily workflow drops sites older than 30 days.\\n\\n**Agent flow.** After export, host the folder with the pages skill (`.agents/skills/pages`). Use `--pr` for a pull request review, or `--name` for anything else. Put a PR review URL in the PR body.\\n\\nPosted by Cursor Grok 4.6 [cursor-grok-4.6]\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-01a0960e-bf59-7deb-9dcf-caf6bfbc542f?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Web\\\" width=\\\"114\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-01a0960e-bf59-7deb-9dcf-caf6bfbc542f&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"131\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\\n\\n\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":6,"text":"  \"user\": {"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":7,"text":"    \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":8,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":9,"text":"  \"merged_at\": \"2026-09-12T20:25:05Z\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":10,"text":"  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"61f79cce8191e348bcd1d72ade335b4c47c18ad9\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":11,"text":"  \"base\": {"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,